<title>NETHERLANDS: Endemol transfers Sport 7 stake.</title>
<headline>Endemol transfers Sport 7 stake.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch television production company Endemol said on Tuesday it was transferring its stake in TV channel Sport 7 to its management.  </p>
<p>In order to contribute to the continuity of Endemol, its founders, Mr. van den Ende and Mr. de Mol, will acquire the stake at the initial price paid, the company said.</p>
<p>The transfer will be finalised as soon as possible.</p>
<p>The company said this decision will have no effect on the production contract between Sport 7 and Endemol Sports.</p>
<p>The board of directors maintains the forecast for Endemol mentioned in the October prospectus.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
